 "P_e328x32": {
  "registered_at": "2026-10-10T07:20:42.949451+00:00",
  "form": "P-e328x32 \u2014 x32's atlas answer APPLIED to e328's design, registered BEFORE e328's compute (the dispatch's ordering); the mapping rule was frozen at x32's BIRTH commit (this file's docstring), the concrete call below is data-derived at COMPLETE and never shopped",
